<title>RUSSIA: Megionneftegaz sees 200 rbl 1996 pref dividend.</title>
<headline>Megionneftegaz sees 200 rbl 1996 pref dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian oil producer Megionneftegaz plans to pay 200 rouble dividends on preferred shares after 605 roubles in 1995 and will again pay no dividends on ordinary shares, the company's registrar said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
